cause of Ebola?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Ebola virus disease is caused by ebolaviruses, which belong to the Filoviridae family, named for their threadlike appearance.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7ba4-b20d-9df7b7bc23f4","description":"Viruses","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-767f-b619-92fb62924aec","description":"Bacteria","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7066-b3d4-9e8f69f2cee7","description":"Parasites","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7328-83ac-36256cbc639d","description":"Fungi","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-741e-b19c-85ee8c15b912","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which of these equations is incorrect?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Six times nine is 54, not 42, so 6 \u00d7 9 = 42 is incorrect.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7197-af1d-8eee0a8fbb8f","description":"6 \u00d7 9 = 42","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-71d5-84a7-2e87e6657600","description":"4 \u00d7 4 = 16","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-71c8-a547-21a0d45e9a3c","description":"7 \u00d7 6 = 42","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7b4c-a202-15efd02566a1","description":"9 \u00d7 7 = 63","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7a1a-95d7-1345af87dbf0","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is Coniology the study of?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Coniology is the study of atmospheric dust and its effects; its name derives from the Greek word konis, meaning dust.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7f07-b3f7-96524a322509","description":"Atmospheric dust and its effects","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7de9-b344-9df4fd102ccf","description":"Life","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-75f7-bfcc-d0de0b2e6441","description":"Human culture","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-7e90-8ddd-05853d62c5cd","description":"Dogs","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3720-76fb-997e-265c39